  "summary": "Cross-namespace ClusterClaim assignment bypass in github.com/openshift/hive",
  "details": "ReconcileClusterClaim.Reconcile assigns hive-claim-owner RBAC to a ClusterDeployment named by the user-controlled ClusterClaim.spec.namespace field without verifying that the ClusterDeployment belongs to a ClusterPool in the claim's namespace. A tenant can target a same-named ClusterClaim in another namespace's ClusterPool and obtain read access to that cluster's admin kubeconfig and password secrets.",
